<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>We provide visualisations of the similarity of different finetune checkpoints at layer 5 on 100 fineweb samples. AvgCosine of finetune checkpoints on different finetune datasets diverge more from the base model than a counterpart checkpoint but stay extremely similar up to 800 steps of finetuning.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F16" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A5.F16.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.01494v1/figures/img/09-appendix/cosine_similarity_layer_5-llama-3.2-1b-qwen-1.7b.png" id="A5.F16.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:247/218;" width="247" height="218" alt="Refer to caption">
